    "Automatic refresh is on (upstream's default): each apply also writes PBF_RESET_FILE_PROTECTIONS, which is what makes PosterBoard re-read the store at boot. Turn it off to leave the device's preferences alone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动刷新已开启（上游的默认行为）：每次应用还会写入 PBF_RESET_FILE_PROTECTIONS，这正是让 PosterBoard 在启动时重新读取数据库的原因。关闭它可以不去动设备的偏好设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
